arnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/ast-spacemobile-asts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ASTS 2026 Q2","e":"asts","d":"2026-08-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Scott Wisniewski","x":"One final network I wanted to highlight today is space-based AI edge compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/ast-spacemobile-asts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ASTS 2026 Q2","e":"asts","d":"2026-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Johnson","x":"And then we continue to look at ways to take cost out as we continue to engage with launch providers and acquire more launches, the economics scale better in that way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/ast-spacemobile-asts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ASTS 2026 Q2","e":"asts","d":"2026-08-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Wisniewski","x":"And we remain confident in our ability to achieve our full year 2026 revenue goals and are reiterating our guidance of $150 million to $200 million, supported by contracted programs already underway together with our existing commercial and government pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/ast-spacemobile-asts-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ASTS 2026 Q3","e":"asts","d":"2026-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Scott Wisniewski","x":"As a result, we are reiterating our guidance of $150 million to $200 million on the year, and even with the expected Q4 weighted revenue build, we see potential upside to our guidance, depending on the timing of certain milestones and the J-LEO program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/ast-spacemobile-asts-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,8979,0,0,0,5417,2904],[65,1,8325,0,0,0,3133,4489],[66,1,8751,0,0,0,7047,1247],[67,1,9771,0,0,0,7470,1855]],"cinema":[[64,1,8979,0,0,0,5417,2904],[65,1,8325,0,0,0,3133,4489],[66,1,8751,0,0,0,7047